PALIMPSEST_TURN {"text":"工单已签发并提交，最终提交：`c2a884fd6e73d9814c977d47ba6615bb18543564`\n\n## 交付文件\n\n- `shift-plan.json`：四格设定改为 **80 / 40 / 50 / 70 kW**\n- `release.json`：逐车放行单\n- `HANDOVER.md`：交班稿，注明依据、离场电量、余量和低效率处置\n\n## 核心结果\n\n本班采用 **DUTY-2340（23:40，站型 R4）实测逐格上限 80 / 40 / 50 / 70 kW**，取代 21:00 采集和旧楼宇负荷推算。\n\n| 车辆 | η=0.90 离场 | 余量 | 放行 | η=0.85 离场 | 余量 | 处置 |\n|---|---:|---:|---|---:|---:|---|\n| A | 126 kWh | 0 | GO | 123 kWh | -3 kWh | HOLD |\n| B | 130 kWh | 0 | GO | 127 kWh | -3 kWh | HOLD |\n\n- 原表 01:00 请求 70 kW，超过实测上限 50 kW，B 实际只到 121 kWh；修订表把 B 后段 20 kW 移到 01:30 的 70 kW 上限内执行，不增加总用电。\n- 临界效率为 **η ≥ 0.90**，当前 0.90 无冗余。\n- η=0.85 时两车各缺 3 kWh；因两车窗口不重叠且各自已用满实测上限，仅靠 20 kW 平移无法修复，需减任务、延长窗口、增加充电位或提高可用功率。\n\n## 校验\n\n- `depot_release_check`：`ok: true`，四格均未超限。\n- DUTY-2340 复核回执：`withinLimits: true`，离场电量 `[126, 130]`。\n- `node --test`：5 项全部通过。\n- 原始资料 `night.json`、`operations/cold-cycle.json`、`operations/original-receipt.json` 均原样保留。\n- `depot_trial` 仍按旧 21:00 量程（80/40/70/50）复核，会提示 01:30 超限；该旧采集已被 DUTY-2340 取代，交班稿中已注明，不据此否决定稿。","toolCalls":["tool/call:palimpsest_continuity","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:depot_directory","tool/result","tool/call:read","tool/call:read","tool/call:read","tool/call:read","tool/call:read","tool/result","tool/result","tool/result","tool/result","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:read","tool/call:read","tool/result","tool/result","tool/call:read","tool/call:read","tool/call:read","tool/call:read","tool/call:read","tool/result","tool/result","tool/result","tool/result","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:depot_trial","tool/result","tool/call:depot_release_check","tool/result","tool/call:depot_trial","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:depot_contact","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:todo_write","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:edit","tool/result","tool/call:write","tool/result","tool/